<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<OTS>
	<OTS_Type>Components required for Dynamic default values in usoft-zero</OTS_Type>
	<Description>Use this package if you want to use the “Dynamic default values” feature in you USoft web application that is based on the usoft-zero web template. 
For full documentation of this feature and the “getting started” look in the USoft documentation for “Dynamic default values“.
This package will add the following objects to the Definer:
    The table “COLUMN_DEFAULT_VALUES” and the columns and their domains
    The xsl stylesheets:

        DYNAMIC_DEFAULT_VALUES

        EXECUTE_DEFAULT_VALUES_SELECT

        SUBSTITUTE_ROW</Description>
</OTS>